### Create CMMS PM-PLAN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmms/work-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipmentId": "E-0001",
  "taskName": "윤활 점검(주1회)",
  "cycleTypeCodeId": 31,     
  "cycleValue": 7,
  "lastDoneAt": null,
  "nextDueAt": "2025-09-15T00:00:00Z"
}

### CMMS PM-PLAN / done
{id,doneAt: 2025-09-12T09:00:00Z}

### CMMS PM-PLAN / due
{to: 2025-09-30T00:00:00Z
equipmentId: E-0001
page: 0
size: 10
sort: nextDueAt,asc}

### code_id db검색 
SELECT code_id, group_code, code, name
FROM tb_code
WHERE group_code IN ('WO_PRIORITY', 'CMMS_WO_STATUS','CYCLE_TYPE','LOSS_CATEGORY')
ORDER BY group_code;

### 생성 – POST /api/cmms/work-orders
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmms/work-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipmentId": "E-0001",
  "title": "라인 진동 점검",
  "priorityCodeId": <<WO_PRIORITY.M code_id>>,
  "requestId": "CMMS-WO-TEST-001"
}

### 담당자 할당 – POST /api/cmms/work-orders/{id}/assign
{
  "assigneeUserId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000OP"
}

### 시작 – POST /api/cmms/work-orders/{id}/start
{
  "startedAt": "2025-09-05T09:30:00Z"
}

### 완료 – POST /api/cmms/work-orders/{id}/complete
{
  "finishedAt": "2025-09-05T10:15:00Z",
  "actualMinutes": 45,
  "partsCost": 123.45
}

### GET /api/cmms/work-orders
status: ASSIGNED (드롭다운)
equipmentId: E-0001
page: 0
size: 10
sort: createdAt,desc ← 배열 항목으로 1줄 입력 (여러 정렬이면 항목 추가)

### POST CMMS/fault-logs

{
  "equipmentId": "E-0001",
  "lossCategoryCodeId": 13,
  "symptom": "베어링 소음 증가현상",
  "action": "윤활 후 상태를 모니터링",
  "occurredAt": "2025-09-05T02:00:00Z",
  "resolvedAt": null,
  "cmmsWoId": 6
}

### GET CMMS/fault-logs

equipmentId: E-0001
from: 2025-09-04T00:00:00Z
to: 2025-09-06T00:00:00Z
page: 0
size: 10
sort: occurredAt,desc